msgstr "Cronología de la transmisión"

#. translators: setting description on what "stream timelines" entails
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:97 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:224
msgid "Receive new posts and notifications in real-time"
msgstr "Recibe nuevas publicaciones y notificaciones en tiempo real"

#. translators: setting that when enabled activates websocket live-updates - even 'local' and 'federated' timelines that get a lot of traffic; stream is a verb, you may replace it with 'live update'
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:101 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:231
msgid "Stream Public Timelines"
msgstr "Cronologías públicas en directo"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:103
msgid ""
"Public means the local and federated ones that usually have a lot of traffic"
msgstr ""
"Público significa los locales y federados que suelen tener mucho tráfico"

#. translators: setting that when enabled reveals post spoilers by default
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:107 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:101
msgid "Reveal Spoilers by Default"
msgstr "Mostrar spoilers de forma predeterminada"

#. translators: setting that when enabled shows a preview of the linked url on posts; card as in the term used for 'component', you may omit it
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:111 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:107
msgid "Show Link Preview Cards"
msgstr "Mostrar vista previa del enlace"

#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:115
msgid "Large Text"
msgstr "Texto grande"

#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:116
msgid "Increase the size of text in posts"
msgstr "Aumentar el tamaño del texto en las publicaciones"

#. translators: setting that when enabled increases the line height of posts; bigger spacing between lines
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:120 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:53
msgid "Large Line Height"
msgstr "Large Line Height (gran altura de línea)"

#. translators: setting subtitle that explains what large line height does
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:121 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:55
msgid "Increase the line height in posts"
msgstr "Aumentar la altura de la línea en las publicaciones"

#. translators: setting that when enabled increases the size of custom emojis when hovered; scale is a verb and you may replace it with "enlarge" "increase the size of"
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:125 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:45
msgid "Scale Custom Emojis on Hover"
msgstr "Ampliar emojis personalizados al pasar el cursor sobre ellos"

#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:126
msgid "lightly increases the size of custom emojis when you hover over them"
msgstr ""
"aumenta ligeramente el tamaño de los emojis personalizados al pasar el "
"cursor por encima de ellos"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:131
msgid "Aggressive User Resolving"
msgstr "Resolución de usuarios agresivos"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:133
msgid ""
"When clicking on a link, Tuba will ask your instance to resolve it to see if "
"it leads to a user or a post regardless if it matches the typical post and "
"user URLs"
msgstr ""
"Al hacer clic en un enlace, Tuba solicitará a tu instancia que lo resuelva "
"para comprobar si conduce a un usuario o a una publicación, "
"independientemente de si coincide con las URL típicas de publicaciones y "
"usuarios"

#. translators: setting that when enabled will automatically remove tracking bits from urls
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:137 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:132
msgid "Strip Tracking Parameters From Links"
msgstr "Eliminar los parámetros de seguimiento de los enlaces"

#. translators: Broken as in incorrect; setting subtitle about stripping tracking parameters from links
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:138 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:134
msgid "This option can lead to broken links when enabled"
msgstr "Si se activa esta opción, pueden aparecer enlaces rotos"

#. translators: setting that when enabled shows attachments in full inside their box rather than zooming in; if unsure, you can find the translation on glitch-soc https://github.com/glitch-soc/mastodon/tree/main/app/javascript/flavours/glitch/locales under the key "settings.media_letterbox"
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:142 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:87
msgid "Letterbox Media"
msgstr "Mantener proporciones al mostrar multimedia"

#. translators: setting subtitle that examplains what letterbox does; if unsure, you can find the translation on glitch-soc https://github.com/glitch-soc/mastodon/tree/main/app/javascript/flavours/glitch/locales under the key "settings.media_letterbox_hint"
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:143 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:89
msgid ""
"Scale down and letterbox media to fill the image containers instead of "
"stretching and cropping them"
msgstr ""
"Reducir y ajustar los archivos multimedia al formato «letterbox» para que "
"ocupen todo el espacio de los contenedores de imagen, en lugar de estirarlos "
"y recortarlos"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated; expand as in enlarge
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:148
msgid "Expand Pictures in Media Viewer"
msgstr "Ampliar imágenes en el visor multimedia"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated; expand as in enlarge
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:150
msgid "Expand pictures to fill the media viewer by default"
msgstr "Ampliar las imágenes para completar el visor multimedia predeterminado"

#. translators: setting that when enabled, makes custom emojis bigger
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:154 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:39
msgid "Large Custom Emojis"
msgstr "Emojis personalizados grandes"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated; leave this as is unless you want to transliterate. BlurHash is a recognizable product name.
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:159
msgid "BlurHash"
msgstr "BlurHash"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:161
msgid "Show a blurred version of the media until they fully load"
msgstr ""
"Mostrar una versión borrosa de los archivos multimedia hasta que se carguen "
"por completo"

#. translators: setting that when enabled reveals attachments that are marked as sensitive by default
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:165 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:95
msgid "Reveal Sensitive Media by Default"
msgstr "Mostrar contenido multimedia sensible de forma predeterminada"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:170
msgid "Group Similar Push Notifications"
msgstr "Agrupar notificaciones push similares"

#. translators: this is meant for "Push Notifications" / the desktop ones, not the in-app ones.
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:171 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:368
msgid ""
"Combine recently pushed notifications of the same type and post into one"
msgstr ""
"Combina las notificaciones enviadas recientemente del mismo tipo y "
"publicación en una sola"

#. translators: setting that when enabled shows a dialog with more options when the user clicks boost on a post; translate boost as all other instances, related to fediverse
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:175 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:118
msgid "Advanced Boost Dialog"
msgstr "Diálogo de impulso avanzado"

#. translators: setting subtitle that explains what the advanced boost dialog allows
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:176 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:120
msgid "Change boost visibility, quote and confirm boosting"
msgstr "Modificar la visibilidad del impulso, citar y confirmar el impulso"

#. translators: setting that when enabled will show the user a warning before allowing them to reply to a very old post
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:180 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:140
msgid "Warn before replying to an old post"
msgstr "Advertir antes de responder a una publicación antigua"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:182
msgid ""
"Before replying to a post that was made at least 3 months ago, Tuba will "
"warn you that the conversation might be over"
msgstr ""
"Antes de responder a una publicación que se hizo hace al menos 3 meses, Tuba "
"le advertirá de que la conversación podría haber terminado"

#. translators: setting that when enabled will show the user a warning before allowing them to boost a post that has attachments without alt text
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:186 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:152
msgid "Warn before boosting a post that includes attachments without alt text"
msgstr "Avisar antes de hacer boost a un post con imágenes sin descripción"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:188
msgid ""
"Before boosting a post that has attachments without alt text, Tuba will warn "
"you"
msgstr ""
"Antes de compartir una publicación que tenga archivos adjuntos sin texto "
"alternativo, Tuba te lo advertirá"

#. translators: setting that when enabled will show the user a warning before allowing them to copy a link to a post that is private
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:192 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:146
msgid "Warn before copying a link to a private post"
msgstr "Advertir antes de copiar un enlace a un mensaje privado"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:194
msgid ""
"If you copy the link to a post that is not publicly accessible, Tuba will "
"warn you that people might not be able to view the post the link points to"
msgstr ""
"Si copia el enlace a una entrada que no es de acceso público, Tuba le "
"advertirá de que es posible que los usuarios no puedan ver la entrada a la "
"que apunta el enlace"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:199
msgid "Spellchecker"
msgstr "Corrector ortográfico"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:201
msgid ""
"The last state of the spellchecker in the composer, can be toggled by right "
"clicking"
msgstr ""
"El último estado del corrector ortográfico en el compositor, se puede "
"cambiar haciendo clic con el botón derecho del ratón"

#. translators: setting that when enabled makes images darker on dark mode until hovered
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:205 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:25
msgid "Darken Images on Dark Mode"
msgstr "Oscurecer las imágenes en el modo oscuro"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:207
msgid ""
"Images will be darker when dark mode is enabled and gain their full "
"brightness when hovered"
msgstr ""
"Las imágenes serán más oscuras cuando el modo oscuro esté activado y ganarán "
"todo su brillo al pasar el ratón por encima"

#. translators: setting that when enabled makes unimportant notification less visible / darker. 'Trivial' describes favorites and boosts
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:211 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:31
msgid "Dim Trivial Notifications"
msgstr "Atenuar notificaciones triviales"

#. translators: setting subtitle that explains what dimming trivial notifications does
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:212 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:33
msgid "Notifications like favorites and boosts will be less visible"
msgstr "Las notificaciones como favoritos e impulsos serán menos visibles"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:217
msgid "The last volume value used in the media viewer for videos and audio"
msgstr ""
"El último valor de volumen usado en el visor multimedia para vídeos y audio"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:222
msgid "Monitor Network Changes"
msgstr "Supervisar los cambios en la red"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:224
msgid ""
"When the network disconnects and reconnects Tuba will detect it and "
"gracefully recover"
msgstr ""
"Cuando la red se desconecte y vuelva a conectarse, Tuba lo detectará y se "
"recuperará de forma automática"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:229
msgid "Proxy URL"
msgstr "Url del proxy"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:231
msgid ""
"Leaving it empty will use the default connection which might be proxied "
"based on the system settings"
msgstr ""
"Si se deja en blanco, se utilizará la conexión predeterminada, que podría "
"pasar por un proxy según la configuración del sistema"

#. translators: setting that when enabled sends the user's settings to tuba's servers (anonymously)
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:235 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:247
msgid "Send Preference Analytics"
msgstr "Analítica de preferencias de envío"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:237
msgid ""
"Send your preferences to Tuba's developers for popularity research biweekly. "
"You can preview exactly what's being sent in-app, they are opt-in and the "
"server is open source."
msgstr ""
"Envía tus preferencias a los desarrolladores de Tuba cada dos semanas para "
"que realicen estudios de popularidad. Puedes ver una vista previa de lo que "
"se envía directamente desde la aplicación; la participación es voluntaria y "
"el servidor es de código abierto."

#. translators: setting title that when enabled gathers tuba's donators every 2nd week; supporters = tuba contributors and sponsors
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:241 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:273
msgid "Update Supporters Periodically"
msgstr "Actualizar a los seguidores/aportantes periódicamente"

#. translators: setting subtitle of what updating supporters entails; you may replace fetch with update or receive; supporters = tuba contributors and sponsors
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:242 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:275
msgid "Fetch the list of Tuba's supporters biweekly"
msgstr "Consulta cada dos semanas la lista de seguidores de Tuba"

#. translators: this string is only shown in dconf, not in the app, you may leave it untranslated
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:247
msgid "Date of the last analytics update"
msgstr "Fecha de la última actualización de las estadísticas"

